    "media:imagetext": "MAR - AUG 2012\nA warm aloha\nfrom our partners\nYour menu was created by\naward-winning Chef Chai\nChaowasaree, a proponent of\nHawaii Regional Cuisine who\nstars in two popular weekly\ncooking shows. To experience\nmore of Chef Chai's creations,\nvisit Chai's Island Bistro at\nAloha Tower Marketplace and\nSingha Thai Cuisine in Waikiki.\nWine pairings are by Master Sommelier Chuck Furuya,\na respected figure in Hawaii's culinary scene.\nYour menu\nChef Chai has created this special Hawaiian-style brunch to\nintroduce the tastes of Hawaii to you on your flight today.\nBrunch\n- WARMED ORANGE CRANBERRY MUFFIN\n- A SELECTION OF FRESH SEASONAL FRUIT\n- CHICKEN CORDON BLEU ROULADE\nWith sautéed spinach and leek fennel gravy\n- SWEET CORN PANCAKES\nWith maple syrup\nFrom our dessert cart\n- Coffee, tea and liqueurs\n- Something special from our chef\nPrior to arrival\n- Dried tropical fruit and nut medley served with your choice\nof beverage\nMahalo for flying with us.\n2015.032.093",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787959511,
